        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Authentic doenjang jjigae uses Korean doenjang paste, which has a much stronger, earthier character than Japanese miso. White miso is a reasonable substitute available in most supermarkets. If you can find doenjang in an Asian grocery, use 2 tablespoons of that instead." }]
